## 1. Original Training Attribution

The trained U-Net checkpoint and experimental results documented in this repository were produced through the U-Net research experiment independently executed and managed by **@Tanika-git**.

The researcher's contributions include:

- Adaptation and configuration of the U-Net training implementation.
- SIDD-Medium sRGB experimental data preparation.
- Kaggle GPU training, troubleshooting and execution.
- Pilot training and completion of the 20,000-step experiment.
- Model checkpoint generation, management and preservation.
- Validation and held-out test evaluation.
- Generation and documentation of PSNR, SSIM, loss curves and experimental results.
- Preservation of experiment logs, configurations and research evidence.

The initial reference implementation was provided through research teammate Nitya Goyal. The subsequent training work and recorded experimental results are attributed to **@Tanika-git**.

